{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "9052c067faf87884f3454d7080973396a2d3a91eecba5c6e95543f13962463de", "ja": "あの頃と、今", "zh": "那时与现在", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a218b37ebcfd32f2a6dbc7779846f89dd8e903741d5f9f600bf27c3cf67b09dc", "ja": "デビュー当時の思い出や、その後の成長に\nついて語り合うメンバーたち。アイドルに\nなったきっかけや、当時抱いていた目標に\nどこまで近づけているかなど、星梨花と\n百合子がそれぞれ自分の思いを語る。", "zh": "成员们畅谈着出道时的回忆，以及之后的成长。\n从成为偶像的契机，到如今距离当时怀抱的目标\n还有多远，星梨花和百合子分别讲述了自己的\n心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c4a41cf8e9b4ee617bbc6ba818dd1ead95c558bc800114e338b401652f62b895", "ja": "密着取材、インタビュー開始……", "zh": "贴身取材、采访开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "6c1e24608e2992bafdc077c4754805a6cf90fd538fdde57d36d404e00d73b9bd", "ja": "それではまず、デビュー当時の話をお願いできますか？\n何を考えていたのかとか、どう感じていたのかとか。", "zh": "那么首先，可以请您谈谈刚出道时的事情吗？\n比如当时在想些什么，又有着怎样的感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "944095b83ff5f19513148804aa84ea17edcbf5e1978f820dd5d18e124ae54f1c", "ja": "デビューした時のことか……。私は、憧れだった\nアイドルになれて、うれしい気持ちでいっぱいでした！", "zh": "是出道时的事啊……我终于成为了憧憬已久的\n偶像，心里满是喜悦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "7da87d6aa1692d4477b91055f755798566806d44f1c92d6be6e4ec09e10fe17b", "ja": "私も、似たような感じで……。でも意外と、\n昔から憧れてたって人ばかりじゃないんですよね。", "zh": "我也差不多是这种感觉……不过，意外的是，并不是所有人从很久以前就憧憬着成为偶像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "54449f230b774dd30ff8f7378776293ffc28b44e5bd4ec86a8ad81c382d74eba", "ja": "私とか、そうです！　自分がアイドルに\nなるなんて、想像したこともなかったですし。", "zh": "像我就是这样！我从来没想过自己会成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "4e54c2f68d6d42e569130188b3f43fa671e98b37edcb22531e20177d45df0b25", "ja": "{$P$}さんがスカウトしてくれ\nなかったら、今も普通の学生をしてただろうなぁ。", "zh": "要是没有{$P$}先生发掘我的话，\n我现在大概也还在当一个普通学生吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1006_staff", "source_sha256": "6bb96692c5035fa5ea88f734835272e750c1940152187cfda9b0e1389f58237d", "ja": "なるほど……。箱崎さんと天空橋さんは、\nいかがでしたか？", "zh": "原来如此……箱崎小姐和天空桥小姐，\n感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "8131d46e68ae746ec5b1c74e38d91f06709e12ea5ebc0a3a58e1df6cc7500cdc", "ja": "私はオーディションですね～。聖母の愛を届ける為に、\nアイドルになろうと決めていましたよ～。", "zh": "我是参加试镜呢～。为了传递圣母的爱，\n我早就决定要成为偶像了哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "59b555cd34b10c4e7d28982242ec97730d9039cd906fe286551a712ef2c252d1", "ja": "わたしもです！　アイドルになったら、\n世の中のことをたくさん知れるって聞いて……。", "zh": "我也是！听说成为偶像的话，\n就能了解很多这个世界上的事情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "b8b891693857ef9deb2448065419f323bc6b7800d54af4a76c62257e39e4cb33", "ja": "自分が知らない、広い世界を見てみたいなって、\nオーディションを受けました！", "zh": "我想看看自己所不知道的广阔世界，所以就来参加选拔了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "f7e64fb94c37d16d4a3ea78013270ee0e4c5908a4104acc217918b867d6a3ac8", "ja": "アイドルって、いろんな経験ができるもんね。\nライブしたり、テレビに出たり……。", "zh": "当偶像可以体验各种各样的事情嘛。  \n比如举办演唱会、上电视……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "cab1f7a01ef68d89259120487a7626ce514adbdb0ddf7ca965db81d738e53317", "ja": "はい！　毎日驚きとワクワクがあって……\nアイドルになって、本当によかったです♪", "zh": "是的！每天都充满惊喜和期待……\n能成为偶像，真的太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1012_staff", "source_sha256": "d3f4d3ba0b485cd251ccd737a2abda9cd81b47b9b46fc839cfd815c4164c660e", "ja": "なるほど。でも、不安になったりしませんか？\n初めての経験ばかりというのは。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，一直都是第一次经历，不会感到不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "16300251bf53e04d4544037cd86c1ecc3b830c8ddbb53403b6871ebff9fbb91f", "ja": "うーん？　みなさんがいっぱい\n教えてくれるので、そういうことはないです。", "zh": "嗯——因为大家都教给我很多，所以不会有那种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "8830906e708679366f2218a0b76fc75c5c1358a757983d9a2e7243623c0fc38d", "ja": "あ、でも！　何でも人に聞きすぎるのは、\nよくないかもって思うこともあります！", "zh": "啊，不过！我有时也会觉得，什么都过多地向别人请教，可能不太好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1015_staff", "source_sha256": "012e46cc5de4a4f1cfd9930e636cd3a96199472afa153a79cac2a779388780cc", "ja": "というと？", "zh": "这话怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "4160f942ab05855999c42d501cf3169f506230de3a0b3fce97069d35c3e89157", "ja": "わたし、知りたいって思ったことは、なんでも\n聞いちゃうクセがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "我一直有个习惯，只要遇到想知道的事，\n就什么都想去问别人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "f26a219212c2204deeef3cbe0fa96bdf9a9c53cf87a7ea8d45698730cd2a91db", "ja": "でも、自分で勉強して、自分で考えて……そうしないと\nずっと成長できないってわかったんです！", "zh": "但是，我明白了，如果不自己学习、自己思考……就永远无法成长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "030d751a19553bdb14eaf10a75718c76f25743fd7c6d4fdb3837386878ed2643", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんは、大切なことに\n気付いたんですね～。", "zh": "星梨花，你已经注意到了重要的事情呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "931000ca2f004ea0c4370721bd8807033113c5022c6c9e637814be1ca6660b96", "ja": "はい。これも、\nアイドルをしていたおかげかも知れません！", "zh": "是的。这或许也是因为成为了偶像，我才能注意到这些！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8fdd0e725da2edc9041c77cd67221619e1125c422437610886903d405aa31d5", "ja": "すごいじゃない、星梨花！　それこそ、\nちゃんと自分で考えて、気付けたことだと思うわ。", "zh": "很了不起嘛，星梨花！这正是你认真思考后，靠自己察觉到的事情呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "df67a6dbd0a5416ae29450771348bb9d4ea61016cc37baad87ae9469dfe251bb", "ja": "えへへ……♪\nありがとうございます、静香さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪\n谢谢你，静香姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1022_staff", "source_sha256": "33499c2a90bbc68c5218bbac15b2df1ee56add6f12fbab524196c3d442ab2ee1", "ja": "アイドルをしていたからこそ……なるほど。\nみなさんも、アイドルになって何か変わりましたか？", "zh": "正因为当过偶像……原来如此。大家成为偶像后，也有什么变化吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "26d29b95fc5b8a440b5921c7c0d3b8d980082ff5a054a614f6c0e5c1409b33dc", "ja": "それはもう、変わりましたよ！\n環境もそうですし、私自身もずいぶん成長しました！", "zh": "那当然是有所改变了！\n不管是环境，还是我自己，都成长了很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "6bb88169a9b1c1d1ec7de7be6a3dd4f699097e6c63e0037ad81efee692d581b2", "ja": "「あの体力がなかった百合子が、歌って踊ってる\nなんて」って、今でも友達にビックリされますし。", "zh": "“那个以前毫无体力的百合子，居然在唱歌\n跳舞”……连朋友直到现在都还会为此感到吃惊呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "dd61d8c82a38f798f78c2a4bee36a16bd58aaad0046ec40f067304fc84c448ac", "ja": "わかるなぁ……最初不安だったよね？　ふふっ。", "zh": "我懂……一开始很不安吧？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "3cdf001df7bc5b5c2fda584a1f4ab8b1931c64ed7b151c20b8dd44cc1f023aed", "ja": "は、はい！　アイドルがこんなに体力勝負\nだったなんて、想像以上で……。", "zh": "是、是的！没想到偶像竟然这么考验体力，完全超出想象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac0bec18c5bdd30fb25d11b01e942bc72efdf83c6867bb2047828c28c7d544fb", "ja": "大変だろうなーって、思ってはいましたけど、\n実際に体験してみると、本当にすごくて……はぁ。", "zh": "虽然之前也觉得肯定会很辛苦，\n但实际体验过后，才发现真的太不容易了……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1028_staff", "source_sha256": "99c27e703d0151c2cb464b0e6b5049e31751157bcb0f5288c9d8accb234dc95c", "ja": "アイドルを続けられないかも、みたいに\n思うことも、やっぱりありましたか？", "zh": "您也曾想过，自己或许无法继续当偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "5dca33e494d4bd03daa1934cc541986bd940af549381d43cb04c60a68b40fa80", "ja": "え？　ええと……それは、あんまりなかったかも？\nいつも、ついていくのがやっとですけど……。", "zh": "诶？呃……那个，好像没怎么想过吧？\n虽然我一直都只是勉强跟得上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "f24f002b62f4f93659bfdae7e0a033e3e36153aab0a7a0f89e67c0710f7704dd", "ja": "仲間もいるし、応援してくれる\nファンのみなさんが、たくさんいますから！", "zh": "因为有伙伴陪着我，还有很多为我加油的粉丝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "4345fe3698552175c4f471ef816552607fbadeba19382dc61d436e79d62434d6", "ja": "それに私、叶えたい目標があるんです！\n私なりのアイドルの形って言うか、夢、かな……？", "zh": "而且，我还有一个想要实现的目标！\n该说是属于我自己的偶像之道，还是说……梦想呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "c1862b34779d8b19fb40a1681a081a6474adac29561f3ada519228ba368c17e7", "ja": "あ、それって……もしかして『物語の伝道師』？\n前にブログにも書いてたよね。", "zh": "啊，难道那就是……“故事的传道师”？\n你之前也在博客上写过吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "dbba153c56482f71f8636e4a656cacc9833dfdc07f520df5443042c71fb6faca", "ja": "読んでくれてたんですか！？　そ、そうですけど……。\n直接言われると、ちょっと恥ずかしいかも……うぅ。", "zh": "您有读过吗！？是、是的没错……不过被您这么直接地说出来，感觉有点不好意思……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "e577e1b5c242707a4e735d969c3b3f53aed7e2d763abb8e450047e80dcb08242", "ja": "うふふ、百合子さんも順調に、\n目標へ向かって進めているようですね～♪", "zh": "呵呵，百合子也是很顺利地，\n在朝着目标前进呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "a8e57dd822f33dfd1ed6ac33dbbe4381748b664b8111907c5bc8d5af864a5b4c", "ja": "百合子は雑誌のコラムや映画の主題歌でも、\nしっかり結果を残せてるものね。", "zh": "百合子在杂志专栏和电影主题曲方面，也都取得了亮眼的成绩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "9f2b6cd1213f4a759efcac8b45930b4716f18f72bdde1ac667faecf7f46b2d0f", "ja": "わたし、百合子さんを見てていつも思います！\nお仕事してる時、すっごく楽しそうだなって♪", "zh": "看着百合子小姐，我总会这么想！\n工作的时候，看起来真的很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1037_staff", "source_sha256": "dfbf94d2b631fc68d3c955ae005affb827ce1339a0266284bc4d109a92153f6f", "ja": "なるほど。七尾さんが、アイドルとして\n頑張り続けられる理由が、わかった気がしますね！", "zh": "原来如此。我好像明白七尾小姐能一直作为偶像努力下去的理由了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "e3e57b3b662845824dc4299fe8202aa7e30f5ea904e93282fc806d9e016915c2", "ja": "えへへ……。アイドルって確かに大変なお仕事ですし、\n私自身、凹んじゃう時もあったりしますけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……偶像确实是一份很辛苦的工作，我自己也会有情绪低落的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1039_026yur", "source_sha256": "fd6bdf92710551e83210e3ba8fc27fc54ba09a3cb9d21744386edc7a64336864", "ja": "その分、うれしいこともたくさんありますからっ！\nだから、えっと……。", "zh": "但是，相应地，也有很多开心的事情！\n所以，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "296b41ccae8344c43c34ba81e781f0d1f0352e057d399a088909946024a55f33", "ja": "一生懸命がんばる姿を、これからも\nたくさんの人に見てもらいたいなって思います♪", "zh": "今后也想让更多人看到我努力拼搏的样子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_03_1041_null", "source_sha256": "76154ccbceeadeac342a0a04ae7ef8613469db61a9fbb7db716f3fc478c450e1", "ja": "密着取材、インタビュー、いったん休憩……", "zh": "贴身采访、访谈、稍事休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
